#ntdiff PRIVATE/NTOS/NTHALS/HALDTI/MIPS/JXRETURN.C PRIVATE/NTOS/NTHALS/HALACR/MIPS/JXRETURN.C
#crlf
=1 1 6
+    dxreturn.c
=1 8 3
+    This module implements the HAL return to firmware function for a
+    DECstation 5000 (MIPS R3000).
=1 12 10
=1 23 11
+
+    The system is restarted by the reboot routine of the firmware.  The
+    firmware keeps its environment on the boot disk, which the drivers of
+    the system own while it runs, so the changes the system makes to the
+    environment wait in memory: the reboot routine writes them, then has
+    the console boot the system again.
=1 38 12
+
=1 50 5
+
=1 55 12
=2 147 4
=2 92 6
+        // Restart through the firmware.
+        //
+
=1 80 10
